&lt;h4 class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1t9c5kj&quot; data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;29&quot;&gt;Your Impact on our Mission&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;31&quot; data-end=&quot;251&quot;&gt;Zocdoc is transforming how patients access healthcare. As Director, Health Systems Sales, you’ll play a critical role in expanding that mission by building strategic partnerships with the nation’s leading health systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;253&quot; data-end=&quot;551&quot;&gt;You’ll lead and develop a high-performing enterprise sales team responsible for acquiring, growing, and strengthening relationships with some of the largest healthcare organizations in the country. You’ll also help shape our commercial strategy, operating model, and approach to sustainable growth.&lt;/p&gt;
