&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;nnht57&quot; data-start=&quot;992&quot; data-end=&quot;1118&quot;&gt;Serious about your work, but not about yourself. Let’s face it - the way things are going, you kind of need a sense of humor&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
