&lt;li&gt;A strong collaborator with excellent communication skills who enjoys being the bridge between engineering, product, and internal stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A believer that diverse and inclusive teams and cultures are non-negotiable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
