&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Motivated by working in a fast-paced, data-driven recruitment environment, where we blend art and science to hit our goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A leader by example; you enjoy inspiring and motivating your peers through a personal demonstration of excellence in your work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly autonomous, and enjoy tackling complex challenges. You welcome ambiguity and get excited about the unknown&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passionate about continuously improving everything you touch, from candidate experience to recruitment processes to stakeholder relationships. You’re not afraid to ask questions and challenge processes and opinions to drive the most impactful recruiting outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
