&lt;li&gt;Monitoring the health of your pipelines, using data to provide relevant updates to partners on all roles, identify areas for improvement, and collaborate with others on solving recruiting challenges&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partnering closely with stakeholders from across the business and proactively keeping everyone in the loop of current role status; fielding questions about process, market conditions, roadblocks, progress, etc.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fostering a culture of excellence, collaboration, and belonging&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
