&lt;li&gt;A passion for building inclusive, diverse teams; you utilize a variety of methods to attract the best talent and deliver an exceptional candidate experience to all&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Humility. You believe in treating all people with dignity and respect, regardless of title or tenure&lt;/li&gt;
