&lt;li&gt;Enjoy partnering cross-functionally to solve complex challenges and deliver exceptional customer outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prefer being in the field, building relationships face-to-face, and are excited by frequent travel to meet with customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are motivated by ambitious goals and view quota as the baseline, not the finish line&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your day to day is…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
