&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7-10 years of Enterprise selling into health systems, with preference for technology/SaaS&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consistently meet/exceed assigned quotas and achieved in top 10% of peers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven track record of building and maintaining C-Suite level client relationships with established boardroom presence&lt;/li&gt;
