&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;*Please note, we are open to remote candidates for this role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Impact on our Mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Staff Software Engineer in the Interoperability group, you will unlock the full potential of our integrations with 170+ EHRs. These integrations enable Zocdoc to pull real-time availability, write back bookings to trigger practice workflows, and exchange appointment data – insurance cards, medical history, and intake forms – between patients and providers. Your leadership will expand their impact across our entire product ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our platform is at an inflection point. New product lines require us to move from eventually-consistent syncs to tighter, fail-fast integrations – a major rearchitecture that you will lead. EHR systems also hold valuable data we&#39;ve only begun to tap: insurance credentialing, provider onboarding signals, patient LTV and more. You will shape both the technical strategy and contribute to the product vision for how we leverage this data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will develop clear abstractions that let other engineering teams leverage our integration capabilities without understanding the inner workings of individual EHRs. You&#39;ll bring order to immense complexity and translate it into simple, powerful interfaces.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will partner with senior product, engineering, and business leaders to define strategic priorities and influence architectural decisions across multiple teams. You will mentor engineers, guide teams through ambiguity, and establish best practices that improve reliability and scalability across our integration stack.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’ll enjoy this role if you are…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Inspired by the opportunity to positively impact the healthcare experience for millions of customers and providers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passionate about building highly scalable platforms with the latest technologies, and excited about developing new and innovative products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A visionary product-driven leader with a relentless focus on customer needs, and excited to partner closely with cross functional teams leading strategic projects from early ideation through successful launch and iteration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Energized by complexity – you see 170+ different integration partners not as chaos but as a puzzle to solve through smart abstractions and clear interfaces&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A fervent champion of engineering fundamentals that enjoys driving adoption of best practices in code health, testing, and maintainability across organizations and teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven leader who mentors and grows teams, cultivates innovation and drives cross-collaboration across multiple teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on and lead by example, shipping code alongside your team, not just from the whiteboard.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A believer that diverse and inclusive teams and cultures are non-negotiable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An entrepreneur with strong ownership who can thrive in an ambiguous and fast changing environment&lt;/li&gt;
