&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your day to day is…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Taking ultimate technical ownership of Zocdoc’s interoperability technical strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building solutions that scale to serve Zocdoc’s largest, most complex customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Driving the rearchitecture of our sync framework to support real-time, fail-fast integration patterns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Designing abstractions that hide EHR-specific complexity and expose clean, consistent capabilities to product teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyzing and decomposing complex product challenges to drive sound design decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working hands-on with your team and shipping production code using C#, AWS technologies, React to millions of users autonomously&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborating with our agile team of dedicated and brilliant engineers, product managers, and designers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Upleveling the interop engineering team through coaching, code reviews, and establishing patterns that the team can follow&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously improving our ability to deliver quality solutions through evolving engineering processes, building technical capabilities and driving strategic investments in our platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’ll be successful in this role if you have…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Successfully architected and shipped high-impact, complex, solutions and frameworks, with experience working across multiple areas of the technology stack and complex system integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building platforms or frameworks that abstract complexity for other engineering teams – you know how to design APIs and interfaces that are a joy to use.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated history of solid and well rounded system design and architectural leadership skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A product mindset – you think beyond the technical implementation to how capabilities translate into customer value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improved developer productivity, efficiency and velocity by setting up and evangelizing best practices for coding, testing, deployment, observability and developer tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Successfully mentored other engineers in the past and have encouraged your peers to use engineering best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Been an outstanding and persuasive communicator capable of delving into technical project details and facilitating technical discussions while also being adept at presenting solutions at an appropriate level of abstraction for a diverse cross-functional audience, including non-technical stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A growth mindset and inspire excellence, acting as a multiplier for your team and the broader engineering organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience successfully working with a distributed workforce preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of significant expertise in backend development. Strong understanding of OO Fundamentals. Experience within AWS environments and a high emphasis on testing is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;Zocdoc is committed to fair and equitable compensation practices. Salary ranges are determined through alignment with market data. Base salary offered is determined by a number of factors including the candidate’s experience, qualifications, and skills. Certain positions are also eligible for variable pay and/or equity; your recruiter will discuss the full compensation package details.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;NYC Base Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$201,400&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$304,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About us&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Zocdoc is the country’s leading digital health marketplace that helps patients easily find and book the care they need. Each month, millions of patients use our free service to find nearby, in-network providers, compare choices based on verified patient reviews, and instantly book in-person or video visits online. Providers participate in Zocdoc’s Marketplace to reach new patients to grow their practice, fill their last-minute openings, and deliver a better healthcare experience. Founded in 2007 with a mission to give power to the patient, our work each day in pursuit of that mission is guided by our&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.zocdoc.com/about/careers-list/&quot;&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;six core values&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;. Zocdoc is a private company backed by some of the world’s leading investors, and we believe we’re still only scratching the surface of what we plan to accomplish.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Zocdoc is a mission-driven organization dedicated to building teams as diverse as the patients and providers we aim to serve. In the spirit of one of our core values - &lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Together, Not Alone&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;, we are a company that prides itself on being highly collaborative, and we believe that diverse perspectives, experiences and contributors make our community and our platform better.&amp;nbsp; We’re an equal opportunity employer committed to providing employees with a work environment free of discrimination and harassment. Applicants are considered for employment regardless of race, color, ethnicity, ancestry, religion, national origin, gender, sex, gender identity, gender expression, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital or parental status, disability, veteran status, or any other class protected by applicable laws.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://zocdocstatic.wpengine.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/ZocDoc-Applicant-CPRA-Notice-Final-2-28-23-.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Job Applicant Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Mission&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Healthcare should work for patients, but it doesn’t. In their time of need, they call down outdated insurance directories. Then wait on hold. Then wait weeks for the privilege of a visit. Then wait in a room solely designed for waiting. Then wait for a surprise bill. In any other consumer industry, the companies delivering such a poor customer experience would not survive. But in healthcare, patients lack market power. Which means they are expected to accept the unacceptable.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Zocdoc’s mission is to give power to the patient. To do that, we’ve built the leading healthcare marketplace that makes it easy to find and book in-person or virtual care in all 50 states, across +200 specialties and +12k insurance plans. By giving patients the ability to see and choose, we give them power. In doing so, we can make healthcare work like every other consumer sector, where businesses compete for customers, not the other way around. In time, this will drive quality up and prices down.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We’re 18 years old and the leader in our space, but we are still just getting started. If you like solving important, complex problems alongside deeply thoughtful, driven, and collaborative teammates, read on.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Impact on Our Mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Technical Account Manager, you’ll serve as a strategic technical partner to Zocdoc’s largest and most complex Enterprise customers. You’ll build a deep understanding of how each customer operates, what they are trying to achieve, and how their technical environment affects their business and patient access to care.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll use technical depth, customer insight, and business judgment to uncover opportunities, anticipate risks, shape practical solutions, and guide customers through complex decisions. You’ll lead cross-functional initiatives that improve provider activation, appointment availability, integration reliability, and operational performance while helping customers realize greater value from Zocdoc.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll also create structure in ambiguous situations, build alignment across customer and internal teams, and turn lessons from individual accounts into repeatable practices for the broader organization. Ultimately, your work will strengthen customer trust, help providers reach more patients, and drive durable growth and retention across Zocdoc’s most important Enterprise partnerships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’ll Enjoy This Role If You…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Create structure and momentum in complex, evolving environments&lt;/strong&gt;, turning unclear requirements, ownership, or solutions into a clear path forward and leading high-impact integrations, migrations, audits, and optimization initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Connect technical decisions to business outcomes&lt;/strong&gt;, using customer context and data to prioritize work that improves provider activation, availability, marketplace inventory, integration reliability, and account performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Translate complexity and influence decisions&lt;/strong&gt;, communicating clearly with senior customer leaders and internal teams while building recommendations that balance technical feasibility, customer value, timing, and competing priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solve immediate problems in ways that improve the future&lt;/strong&gt;, balancing urgent customer needs with scalable solutions that reduce recurring issues, operational friction, and long-term risk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learn quickly, build trust, and raise the standard&lt;/strong&gt;, staying effective in unfamiliar situations, communicating transparently during high-stakes moments, and turning lessons into stronger processes, documentation, and guidance for the broader team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Day-to-Day&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The essential functions include, but are not limited to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the strategic technical relationship for a complex Enterprise book of business&lt;/strong&gt;, building a deep understanding of each customer’s business, workflows, priorities, success measures, risks, and growth objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead consultative discovery with customers and account teams&lt;/strong&gt;, asking questions that uncover the business problem behind a technical request and translating customer goals into practical technical strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape and recommend solutions that balance customer value, technical feasibility, timing, risk, and commercial importance.&lt;/strong&gt; Challenge requested approaches when they are unlikely to achieve the intended outcome.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Serve as a trusted advisor through complex customer decisions&lt;/strong&gt;, including integrations, migrations, audits, optimization efforts, escalations, renewals, and growth initiatives. Set expectations, manage tradeoffs, and maintain alignment across technical, operational, and executive stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use customer data and technical insight to identify and prioritize opportunities and risks&lt;/strong&gt;, improving outcomes such as provider activation, availability, inventory, integration reliability, customer experience, retention, and growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead complex initiatives through influence and accountability&lt;/strong&gt;, creating structure when the path is unclear, coordinating internal and customer stakeholders, managing dependencies, and driving commitments through implementation and validation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Maintain sufficient technical depth to diagnose issues, evaluate tradeoffs, and guide durable solutions&lt;/strong&gt;, while engaging the right technical partners for detailed execution when appropriate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’ll Be Successful in This Role If You Have…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years in a customer-facing technical role, including experience with complex Enterprise customers, strategic accounts, or cross-functional technical initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience owning complex customer work from discovery and planning through implementation and validation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong consultative skills and the ability to connect customer needs to practical technical solutions and business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical depth to diagnose integration, configuration, data, or workflow issues and guide durable resolutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication, influence, and project leadership skills, including managing expectations, risks, dependencies, and accountability across teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to learn new technologies and customer environments quickly and turn that learning into better recommendations, processes, and team practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with healthcare technology, EHRs, scheduling systems, or complex integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of APIs, data flows, network behavior, and technical configurations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with tools such as Jira, Confluence, Postman, Salesforce, or similar platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relevant degree, certifications, or equivalent professional experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unlimited Vacation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;100% paid employee health benefit options (including medical, dental, and vision)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commuter Benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;401(k) with employer funded match&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Corporate wellness programs through Wellhub&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sabbatical leave (for employees with 5+ years of service)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive paid parental leave and fertility/family planning reimbursement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cell phone reimbursement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Resource Groups and ZocClubs to promote shared community and belonging&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Great Place to Work Certified&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;Zocdoc is committed to fair and equitable compensation practices. Salary ranges are determined through alignment with market data. Base salary offered is determined by a number of factors including the candidate’s experience, qualifications, and skills. Certain positions are also eligible for variable pay and/or equity; your recruiter will discuss the full compensation package details.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;NYC Base Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$132,500&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$179,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About us&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Zocdoc is the country’s leading digital health marketplace that helps patients easily find and book the care they need. Each month, millions of patients use our free service to find nearby, in-network providers, compare choices based on verified patient reviews, and instantly book in-person or video visits online. Providers participate in Zocdoc’s Marketplace to reach new patients to grow their practice, fill their last-minute openings, and deliver a better healthcare experience. Founded in 2007 with a mission to give power to the patient, our work each day in pursuit of that mission is guided by our&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.zocdoc.com/about/careers-list/&quot;&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;six core values&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;. Zocdoc is a private company backed by some of the world’s leading investors, and we believe we’re still only scratching the surface of what we plan to accomplish.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
