&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;ll Be Successful in This Role If You...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have 7+ years of experience building or evolving internal developer platforms, productivity tooling, or CI/CD systems used by multiple teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have designed and operated distributed systems in AWS or similar cloud environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring strong judgment around platform abstractions and APIs — knowing when to standardize and when to stay flexible&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Can take ambiguous problems, break them into deliverable pieces, and drive them to measurable outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communicate technical trade-offs clearly to both technical and non-technical audiences&lt;/strong&gt; — translating engineering concepts into terms that resonate with stakeholders outside of software development&lt;/li&gt;
