&lt;li&gt;A builder who loves taking products from zero to one and turning ambiguous opportunities into real products customers use&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Energized by startup environments where speed, ownership, resourcefulness, and judgment matter&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable moving between long term strategy, detailed workflow design, technical conversations, customer research, and execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The kind of person who can turn a broad opportunity into clear crawl, walk, and run solutions&lt;/li&gt;
