&lt;li&gt;Developing a deep understanding of the financial workflows, pain points, and goals of healthcare practices through customer research, data analysis, and close partnership with internal teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Defining the long term product vision and strategy for payments within Practice Solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rolling up your sleeves to drive execution with deep complexity and at scale&lt;/li&gt;
