&lt;li&gt;Amazing perks – think catered lunch every day, Ping Pong, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Daycare/creche facility for kids&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The chance to create a better healthcare experience for millions of patients!&lt;/li&gt;
